al representation. They are to play the psychological horror of being alienated, the cosmical horror of knowing too much, the desperation of your own mind falling apart night after night (like Alzheimer). In my opinion, they should have been a bloodline, not a clan, they are for advanced players. And even if you still want to point that you need them as examples to follow, to being &quot;represented&quot; in a roleplaying game, take a look at the other titles of White wolf, you could found other approaching to mental illness more respectful or more interesting to play that being a funny pranker.<br /> <br /> (And this is my last entry about this, I have spent too much hours of my life trying to explain this to other players).</div> </div> </div> </div>That's one way to play it.<br /> <br /> But I speak for myself and the Malkavians are guys I have the symbol of tattooed on my arm (or at least will after next con).<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" tar