ights.</div> </div> </div> </div>No Warform as of yet, but that could be introduced as a Loresheet thing much like the Monstrous Bat form exists for Gangrel that take the Loresheet level 4 Advantage if they are a Descendent of Xavier","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;The only consistent wisdom is in knowing you know nothing&quot; ~ Socrates <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://i.imgur.com/PbrO9Kq.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1197-imthestein","name":"Imthestein","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1197_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"238"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-30T14:37:56-07:00","id":1315579,"title":"","content":"I'm expecting a &quot;war form&quot; Protean 4 power to appear with the Tzimisce, which could also be used by the Ministry.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24808-draconis","name":"Draconis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24808_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"805"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-30T15:16:28-07:00","id":1315589,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Draconis</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1298479-bloodlines-2-announced?p=1315579#post1315579\" rel=\"nofoll