\" src=\"https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/C9ZfnqTnb4WPi5cvuqtud8-1920-80.jpg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.pcgamer.com/uk/amp/paradox-is-happy-with-the-progress-of-bloodlines-2-but-wont-reveal-who-is-making-it/\" target=\"_blank\"> Paradox is 'happy with the progress' of Bloodlines 2, but won't reveal who is making it </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.pcgamer.com/uk/amp/paradox-is-happy-with-the-progress-of-bloodlines-2-but-wont-reveal-who-is-making-it/\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.pcgamer.com/uk/amp/paradox-is-happy-with-the-progress-of-bloodlines-2-but-wont-reveal-who-is-making-it/ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> No word on the vampire RPG's release date either. </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> During the Q&amp;A section of Paradox Interactive's Q3 interim report, the topic of Vampire: The Masquerade \u2013 Bloodlines 2 inevitably came up. The question asked was simply: &quot;Any news on Bloodlines 2 or its developer?&quot; To which Paradox CFO Alexander Bricca replied, &quot;The new developer is doing quite well and we are happy with the progress of the project now, but it's still quite some time before we can start to talk about release dates. </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1208-grumpy-rpg-reviews","name":"Grumpy RPG Reviews","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1208_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1888"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-16T16:42:11-08:00","id":1468072,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"b