/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1298479-bloodlines-2-announced?p=1468072#post1468072\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Anyone want to bet they don't want to reveal who made it until it is finished?</div> </div> </div> </div>There is a good chance of that, but it is unusual. I mean, the brand and reputation of a particular studio is usually part of the marketing of a game.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1208-grumpy-rpg-reviews","name":"Grumpy RPG Reviews","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1208_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1888"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-16T20:20:11-08:00","id":1468094,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Grumpy RPG Reviews</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1298479-bloodlines-2-announced?p=1468091#post1468091\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">There is a good chance of that, but it is unusual. I mean, the brand and reputation of a particular studio is usually part of the marketing of a game.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes, but changes in production staff complicate things a lot, especially for a sequel.<br /> <br /> At this point, releasing the information can harm the developers more than help.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-17T04:58:24-08:00","id":1468112,"title":"","content":".-<span style=\"color:#D93025\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">15.70 </span></span></span><span style=\"color:#D93025\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">(-52.95%)</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#D93025\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">past year</span></span></span><br /> <br /> Paradox's stock price is half of what it was a year ago, Vampire isn't their only game of course, but it doesn't seem like there's much confidence in them now. This comment seems like &quot;Oh no, it's going down, better say something&quot; rather than something of note. It's a shame really, had they released in 2020 with the pandemic keeping us all inside, they would've raked it in. People were obviously excited for this game.<br /> It's worth noting that they're still worth more now than they were in 2017<br /> <br /> Edit: Continued on next page","signature":"","edited":{"userid":25794,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","user":"MyWifeIsScary","date":". 11-17-2021, 08:38 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-17T05:37:39-08:00","id":1468118,"title":"","content":"Ah look, they just added $1.50 per share. Maybe it is working.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-17T06:29:25-08:00","id":1468125,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MyWifeIsScary</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1298479-bloodlines-2-announced?p=1468118#post1468118\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Ah look, they just added $1.50 per share. Maybe it is working.</div> </div> </div> </div>The comment does add some information, it shows that they are still paying attention to the development. But their situation is complicated.<br /> <br /> 50% is a huge loss of confidence, although it may be the result of previous build-up being released. Bloodlines 2 was highly expected, so the same way that this fumble cut their price, the expectation of release could have hyped it beyond reason, so you go from a number that don't quite represent their actual value to another number that don't quite represent their actual value.<br /> <br /> Either way, this is a very delicate moment for them. In my opinion, building up hype for the release of Bloodlines 2 may have been an error. They have the IP and other products coming, they should have waited the game's completion to announce that it even existed, a point where even a change of developers wouldn't left anything to do but final tests and debugging.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-17T09:44:05-08:00","id":1468146,"title":"","content":"Frankly I don't have much faith in the product for a number of reasons. Cancelled my Pre order and I'll wait for word of mouth. Pre orders are a bad idea anyway.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26986-ragged-robin","name":"Ragged Robin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26986_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1720"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-17T11:27:11-08:00","id":1468158,"title":"","content":"The White Wolf section of Paradox is not remotely its primary source of income.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Fall